<title>USA: CME average feeder steer price. [CORRECTED 22:33 GMT]</title>
<headline>CME average feeder steer price. [CORRECTED 22:33 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange reported the average feeder steer price for the seven calendar days ending Wednesday, Jan 1 used for cash settlement of CME Feeder Cattle contracts. (in dollars per cwt) --</p>
<p>12-STATES - FOR 7 DAYS ENDING -</p>
<p>Wednesday    Jan  1   $64.37    unc</p>
<p>Tuesday	Dec 31   $64.37    dn 0.03</p>
<p>Monday	 Dec 30   $64.40    dn 0.05</p>
<p>(corrects dates in the table)</p>
</text>
